---
// comissions/Header.astro
---

<section class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto">
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-stretch gap-6">
    <!-- Texto -->
    <div
      class="flex-1 border-2 border-gray-400 bg-gray-300 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] flex flex-col transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:scale-101"
    >
      <!-- Barra de título -->
      <div
        class="h-8 bg-[#573070] flex items-center justify-between px-2 shrink-0"
      >
        <span class="text-white text-sm font-bold">about.txt</span>
        <button
          data-close
          aria-label="Cerrar ventana"
          class="w-6 h-6 bg-gray-300 border border-t-white border-l-white border-b-black border-r-black flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-gray-400 active:border-t-black active:border-l-black active:border-b-white active:border-r-white"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="3"
            stroke-linecap="square"
            class="w-3 h-3 text-black"
          >
            <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
            <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Contenido -->
      <div class="p-4 space-y-3 flex flex-col flex-1 font-family-comic">
        <div
          class="bg-white border-2 border-t-gray-600 border-l-gray-600 border-b-white border-r-white p-3 shrink-0"
        >
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-bold text-black">
            sobreeee mii ヽ(✿ﾟ▽ﾟ)ノ
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-white border-2 border-t-gray-600 border-l-gray-600 border-b-white border-r-white p-3 flex-1"
        >
          <p class="text-sm text-black leading-relaxed">
            ¡Hola! Soy Drygo, si tienes alguna idea o propuesta que quieras
            volver realidad, encontraste a la persona indicada!
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-black leading-relaxed mt-2">
            Tengo muchos servicios que te podria ofrecer, asi que no dudes en
            contactarme si es que estas interesado ^^
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Imagen -->
    <div
      class="flex-1 border-2 border-gray-400 bg-gray-300 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 hover:scale-101"
    >
      <!-- Barra de título -->
      <div class="h-8 bg-[#573070] flex items-center justify-between px-2">
        <span class="text-white text-sm font-bold">drygo.png</span>
        <button
          data-close
          aria-label="Cerrar ventana"
          class="w-6 h-6 bg-gray-300 border border-t-white border-l-white border-b-black border-r-black flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-gray-400 active:border-t-black active:border-l-black active:border-b-white active:border-r-white"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="3"
            stroke-linecap="square"
            class="w-3 h-3 text-black"
          >
            <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
            <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Imagen -->
      <div class="p-4">
        <div
          class="border-2 border-t-gray-600 border-l-gray-600 border-b-white border-r-white bg-[#241a2e] p-4 flex justify-center"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/fallin.webp"
            alt="drygo image"
            class="w-auto max-h-40"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
